        "deleted_at": null,
        "description": "Twarabiye hamwe ubuhanuzi bwavuzwe kub'Isirayeli dusomye mu gitabo c'uwavugishwa n'Imana Amosi guhera mu gice ca 2 : 9 - gushika mu gice ca 3 : 2 . Imana rero yaravuze yuko izohanira Ab' Isirayeli ibigabitanyo vyabo , yarabibukije yuko ariyo yabaduganye ibakuye mu buja barimwo mu gihugui ca Egiputa ikabaha igihugu cabo. Ico gihugu yacirukanyemwo amahanga y'abanyavyaha yari abangamiye Ab'Isirayeli maze ibandanya kubaha ivyagezwe vyayo vyinshi. Vyari bikenewe rero yuko boguma bibuka k'Uhoraho ariyo Mana yabo ntibaje gusenga izindi Mana zitarizo. Ariko ivyo yababwiye babikubise hasi nico catumye ibabwira yuko izobateza intambara bagapfa abandi bagahunga.",
